  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Recruitment and Mission Support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Personalf&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjning till internationella insatser</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademin (FBA) har i uppdrag att st&#xe4;lla svensk personal till f&#xf6;rfogande f&#xf6;r internationella civila krishanteringsinsatser som genomf&#xf6;rs av multilaterala organisationer s&#xe5;som Europeiska unionen (EU), F&#xf6;renta nationerna (FN) och Organisation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Folke Bernadotte Academy (FBA) is tasked with providing Swedish personnel for international civil crisis management operations being carried out by multilateral organisations such as the European Union (EU), the United Nations (UN), and the Organizati</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademin (FBA) rekryterar och s&#xe4;nder ut civil personal till internationella fredsinsatser som Sverige deltar i, fr&#xe4;mst insatser som leds av EU, FN eller OSSE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Folke Bernadotte Academy (FBA) recruits and deploys civilian experts to international peace operations which Sweden contributes personnel to. The operations are mostly led by the UN, EU and OSCE.</narrative>
  </description>
